{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:56:46.145Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f1c672966e36660c538271d5c05f50494f3e28450770c2debc7e206781c9252d","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Quillfeather account owner roster"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/agent-notes/2025-03-10-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/coastal-cheatsheet","heldout/agent-notes/2025-09-15-strategic-digest","heldout/notes/2026-06-01-strategic-qbr-plan","heldout/agent-notes/2026-09-30-strategic-digest","heldout/chats/2026-07-01-vantorre-seats-retraction","heldout/chats/strategic-pod-banter","heldout/agent-notes/strategic-cheatsheet","heldout/agent-notes/2026-05-04-strategic-digest","heldout/chats/2026-08-03-vtg-sev1-war-room","heldout/agent-notes/2025-07-07-strategic-digest","heldout/notes/2026-01-15-hr-benefits-reminder"],"count":12,"latency_ms":157,"sources":["public","channel-strategic-pod","team-strategic-members","channel-inc-vtg-hartford"]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:56:53.793Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"00782e082b82fa28386d52bebb93c187b37e3fd1c71738ed52cf27f91f7b15a8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests and the channel history show. Two of the four owners are firm, one is an inference, and one isn't named at all.\n\n- **Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato.** It was Nadia Fennimore's account and moved to Gideon on **2026-05-04**. The 5/4 digest says \"Nadia's old industrial account has been reassigned in the CRM\" effective that day. It then calls it \"Gideon's industrial account\", and the 8/3 digest and the #inc-vtg-hartford thread both confirm Gideon as the owner. The digest doesn't name the account on the 5/4 line, so that date comes from \"Nadia's old industrial account\" and the Gideon references that follow. I'd check it against the CRM record before it goes on the board slide.\n- **Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato.** The 9/30 digest has Gideon handling it. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day, but digests from 2025 already call it \"the account Gideon runs\". I'd read it as Gideon either way, but the digests contradict each other on when it started.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, probably.** The 3/2025 digest calls it \"Nadia's medical account\". The 12/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\" without naming Orlavine. Orlavine is the only medical account in the Strategic digests, so I'm inferring Gideon. No digest records the handoff date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters: no owner named.** The digests only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia volunteered to run a training session for them on 9/30, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please confirm this one with Nadia or Gideon, or check the CRM."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
